<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Fogade to sell Seguros Royal stock.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Fogade to sell Seguros Royal stock.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Bank Deposits Guarantee Fund (Fogade) will start Tuesday the sale of Seguros Royal Caribe insurance company stock with the opening of the data room.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it was selling 40.6 percent of the company's stock it inherited when Sociedad Financiera Fiveca went bankrupt in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
